## Layout conventions

- Projects live directly under this folder, one directory per project.
- `_shared/` holds cross-project adapters catalogued in `_shared/data-catalog/CATALOG.md`.
- `docs/lessons/` is per-project; workspace-wide learnings that repeat across projects get promoted here.

## Deliberately outside this folder — do not move

- `<path>` — reason (`launchd plist` / `virtualenv` / `tunnel config` wired to absolute path)
- `~/.cloudflared/<tunnel>.json` — Cloudflare Tunnel credentials (one file per tunnel)

## How to add a project

1. `scripts/new-project.sh <name> --stack next|vite|python` (or let `BLUEPRINT.md` do it via an agent).
2. Fill in `<project>/CLAUDE.md` from `templates/CLAUDE.md.template`.
3. Add one row above. Keep it honest — `dormant` saves the next agent twenty minutes.
